OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 8, taken to hospital
OL,4,Afollowing crash in Perth
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year-old boy has been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital for treatment after being hit
OL,8,Fby a vehicle in Perth.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on Crieff Road at
OL,11,Fabout 08:50.
OL,13,FThe road was closed between Tulloch
OL,14,FRoad and Fairfield Road for about an
OL,15,Fhour as a result of the collision.
OL,17,FThere is currently no information on
OL,18,Fthe condition of the boy.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
